ipeline of clinical and preclinical product candidates in development for neurological disorders. Its marketed products include ARISTADA, an intramuscular injectable suspension for the treatment of schizophrenia; ARISTADA INITIO for the treatment of schizophrenia in adults; VIVITROL for the treatment of alcohol and prevention of opioid dependence; LYBALVI, an oral atypical antipsychotic drug candidate for the treatment of adults with schizophrenia and bipolar I disorder; and LUMRYZ, an extended-release oral suspension product for the treatment of cataplexy or EDS in pediatric patients. The company also offers proprietary technology platforms to third parties to enable them to develop, commercialize, and manufacture products. It has collaboration agreements primarily with Janssen Pharmaceutica N.V., Janssen Pharmaceutica Inc, and Janssen Pharmaceutica International. Alkermes plc was founded in 1987 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.","description_en":"Alkermes plc, a biopharmaceutical company, engages in the research, development, and commercialization of pharmaceutical products to address unmet medical needs of patients in therapeutic areas in the United States, Ireland, and internationally. The company has a portfolio of proprietary commercial products for the treatment of opioid dependence, alcohol dependence, schizophrenia, bipolar I, and a pipeline of clinical and preclinical product candidates in development for neurological disorders. Its marketed products include ARISTADA, an intramuscular injectable suspension for the treatment of schizophrenia; ARISTADA INITIO for the treatment of schizophrenia in adults; VIVITROL for the treatment of alcohol and prevention of opioid dependence; LYBALVI, an oral atypical antipsychotic drug candidate for the treatment of adults with schizophrenia and bipolar I disorder; and LUMRYZ, an extended-release oral suspension product for the treatment of cataplexy or EDS in pediatric patients. The company also offers proprietary technology platforms to third parties to enable them to develop, commercialize, and manufacture products. It has collaboration agreements primarily with Janssen Pharmaceutica N.V., Janssen Pharmaceutica Inc, and Janssen Pharmaceutica International. Alkermes plc was founded in 1987 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.","description_zh":"Alkermes plc（美股代碼：ALKS）為 Healthcare 領域之重要企業，專注於 Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Connaught House","city":"Dublin","state":"DU","zip":"D04 C5Y6","country":"IE","phone":"353 1 772 8000","full_address":"Connaught House, Dublin, DU D04 C5Y6, IE","range_52w":"27-55.67","year_high":55.67,"year_low":27,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":27,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-11-03","name":"Gaffin David Joseph","title":"officer: EVP, CLO, Alkermes, Inc.","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":2035,"price":46.17,"total_val":0.09},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Reed Joshua","title":"officer: SVP, Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":9164,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Reed Joshua","title":"officer: SVP, Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":9164,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Reed Joshua","title":"officer: SVP, Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":4069,"price":40.11,"total_val":0.16},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Whitaker Anne Clem","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":17998,"price":41.45,"total_val":0.75},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Whitaker Anne Clem","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":7239,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Gaffin David Joseph","title":"officer: EVP, CLO, Alkermes, Inc.","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":2034,"price":41.03,"total_val":0.08},{"date":"2026-09-18","name":"Whitaker Anne Clem","title":"dir